== Effects ==
* Upon use, consumes one {{E|Penny}} to deal damage to all enemies in the [[room]].
** {{dlc|nr}} Damage dealt is equal to twice Isaac's [[damage]].
** {{dlc|r}} Damage dealt is twice Isaac's [[damage]] +10.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc|r}} The item will cost 10 cents if found in a {{r|Shop}}.
* This item becomes more valuable once {{R|Shop}}s stop appearing.

== Synergies ==
* {{Book of Belial synergy|description=Also has a chance to invoke the effect of {{i|Golden Razor}}.}}
* {{Book of Virtues synergy|description=Spawns wisps in the inner ring, looking like coins. The wisps have a chance to drop [[coin]]s when destroyed.}}
* {{dlc+|nr}}{{i|Isaac's Heart}} + {{I|Schoolbag}} + {{i|IV Bag}}: Allows for effectively infinite uses by switching to IV Bag when low on money, with Isaac's Heart preventing it from lowering the player's [[health]]. {{dlc-}}
* {{T|Mysterious Candy}}: Allows for effectively infinite uses with extreme patience - efficiency can be greatly increased with {{T|Petrified Poop}}.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Car Battery}}: No effect.
* {{i|Ipecac|r}}: Damage boost is mostly ignored.

